      <p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/operating_modes/sample_health_index_historical_data.dita" xtrc="p:1;25:10">Figure 10 shows the Health Index Historical Data as a scatter plot generated by analysing the data received from the SMS by the ADI OtoSense™ Server.</p>
      <ul id="ul_10211505" class="- topic/ul " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/operating_modes/sample_health_index_historical_data.dita" xtrc="ul:1;26:28">
         <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/operating_modes/sample_health_index_historical_data.dita" xtrc="li:1;27:14">The scatter plot’s <b class="+ topic/ph hi-d/b " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/operating_modes/sample_health_index_historical_data.dita" xtrc="b:1;27:36">X-axis</b> shows the 1-10 scale of the Health Index.</li>
         <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/operating_modes/sample_health_index_historical_data.dita" xtrc="li:2;28:14">The scatter plot’s <b class="+ topic/ph hi-d/b " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/operating_modes/sample_health_index_historical_data.dita" xtrc="b:2;28:36">Y-axis</b> shows all dates between 01 September 2024 and 10 November 2024.</li>
      </ul>
      <ul class="- topic/ul " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/operating_modes/sample_health_index_historical_data.dita" xtrc="ul:2;30:11">
