               </image>icon is a data point for the Performance parameter of the motor.</p>
         </li>
         <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/operating_modes/sample_health_index_historical_data.dita" xtrc="li:4;36:14">
