         <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/operating_modes/sample_health_index_historical_data.dita" xtrc="li:6;48:14">
            <p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/operating_modes/sample_health_index_historical_data.dita" xtrc="p:4;49:16">You can analyse the clusters and outliers to better understand the underlying issues.</p>
            <p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/operating_modes/sample_health_index_historical_data.dita" xtrc="p:5;50:16">For example, data points that fall below 5 on the health index should be further analysed and appropriate action should be taken.</p>
         </li>
